`ifndef HISI_MIPI_RX_CV300_RDL
`define HISI_MIPI_RX_CV300_RDL


regfile eHISI_MIPI_RX_CV300 {
    name = "MIPI RX (sensor serial interface receiver, Hi3516C V300 / Hi3516E V100)";
    desc = "
    MIPI RX (combo PHY + controller for MIPI D-PHY CSI-2, LVDS / sub-LVDS / HiSPI and CMOS parallel sensors, feeding the VICAP) of the Hi3516C V300 / Hi3516E V100 at 0x11300000. Second-generation layout: PHY link 0 registers at 0x0 (PHY_MODE_LINK0 .. PHY_SYNC_CODEn_LINK0, CIL interrupts at 0x1F0), channel/system registers at 0x800 (CHN0_*, PHY_ID), the MIPI controller of device 0 at 0x1000 (MIPI0_*: lanes, DI, packet/frame/line interrupts, DOL IDs, crop, image-size statistics) and the LVDS controller at 0x1300 (LVDS0_*: WDR, crop, per-lane SOF/EOF/SOL/EOL and next-frame sync codes, LI words, statistics) plus ALIGN0_* at 0x1600. 78 of these 143 registers also appear (same names) in the 421-register Hi3516A V200 / Hi3519 V101 block `eHISI_MIPI_RX_AV200`. The header (COMBO_MAX_DEV_NUM 1, 4 lanes per link) matches the data sheet register for register. Non-hardware-verified transcription.

    Generated 2026-11-10 by build/rdl-audit/video-rdl-scratch/gen_blocks.py: mechanical transcription of the data sheet register tables (ds_extract2 + description extraction from the PDF) merged with the vendor header; not hardware verified.

    Register sources: 143 registers from the data sheet (hi3516cv300--Hi3516CV300-Hi3516EV100-Datasheet.txt, section 9.3.6); 0 registers and 1 fields from OpenIPC openhisilicon `kernel/mipi_rx/hi3516cv300/mipi_reg.h` (GPL-3.0 repository, HiSilicon copyright; local copy sources/openhisilicon) (GPL-3.0 repository, HiSilicon copyright), each marked `[inferred]` in its desc (names from the header, meanings inferred from the names, reset/access unknown). 6 field names that the data-sheet text extraction garbled (two column cells run together) were taken from the header. Name differences, data sheet kept: 0x20 PHY_DATA_MIPI_LINK0 [7:0] DS sphy0_data0_mipi_hs / header phy_data0_mipi_hs; 0x20 PHY_DATA_MIPI_LINK0 [15:8] DS sphy0_data1_mipi_hsphy0_data0_mipi_h / header phy_data1_mipi_hs; 0x20 PHY_DATA_MIPI_LINK0 [23:16] DS sphy0_data2_mipi_hsphy0_data1_mipi_h / header phy_data2_mipi_hs; 0x20 PHY_DATA_MIPI_LINK0 [31:24] DS phy0_data3_mipi_hsphy0_data2_mipi_h / header phy_data3_mipi_hs; 0x1250 MIPI0_IMGSIZE0_STATIS [15:0] data-sheet text `c0imgwidth_statis_vc` garbled, header name imgwidth_statis_vc used; 0x1250 MIPI0_IMGSIZE0_STATIS [31:16] data-sheet text `imgheight_statis_vc0imgwidth_statis_vc` garbled, header name imgheight_statis_vc used; 0x1258 MIPI0_IMGSIZE2_STATIS [15:0] data-sheet text `c2imgwidth_statis_vc` garbled, header name imgwidth_statis_vc used; 0x1258 MIPI0_IMGSIZE2_STATIS [31:16] data-sheet text `imgheight_statis_vc2imgwidth_statis_vc` garbled, header name imgheight_statis_vc used; 0x125C MIPI0_IMGSIZE3_STATIS [15:0] data-sheet text `c3imgwidth_statis_vc` garbled, header name imgwidth_statis_vc used; 0x125C MIPI0_IMGSIZE3_STATIS [31:16] data-sheet text `imgheight_statis_vc3imgwidth_statis_vc` garbled, header name imgheight_statis_vc used; 0x1308 LVDS0_DOLSCD_HBLK header field dol_hblank1 [11:0] overlaps DS fields differently; 0x1308 LVDS0_DOLSCD_HBLK header field dol_hblank2 [27:16] overlaps DS fields differently; 0x13A0 LVDS0_LANE0_NXT_SOF_01 [15:0] DS lane0